# CalledIt (txline-fan) — environment configuration
# Copy to .env.local. The demo runs on the deterministic mock/replay feed and needs
# NONE of these. Set TXLINE_JWT + TXLINE_API_TOKEN and the app auto-flips to LIVE
# TxLINE data (the SSE proxy routes gate purely on the presence of both).

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Devnet subscribe → activate flow (how to obtain the two creds above)
#
#   1. Fund a Solana devnet keypair (free):
#        solana-keygen new -o ~/.config/solana/id.json   # if you don't have one
#        solana airdrop 2 --url devnet
#   2. Mint an API token end-to-end (on-chain subscribe → guest JWT → activate):
#        SOLANA_KEYPAIR=~/.config/solana/id.json npm run txline:subscribe
#      This broadcasts a REAL devnet tx and writes TXLINE_JWT + TXLINE_API_TOKEN
#      (+ TXLINE_NETWORK) into .env.local for you.
#   3. Already have an issued token? Validate + wire it instead of subscribing:
#        TXLINE_API_TOKEN=<token> npm run txline:activate
#   4. Run the app:  npm run dev
# See docs/txline-setup.md for the full runbook.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Network selector -------------------------------------------------------
# One switch chooses the TxLINE host, the txoracle program id, and the Solana
# cluster. "devnet" (default, free, devnet SOL) or "mainnet".
TXLINE_NETWORK=devnet
# Optional explicit host override (derived from TXLINE_NETWORK when unset):
#   devnet  → https://txline-dev.txodds.com
#   mainnet → https://txline.txodds.com
# TXLINE_BASE_URL=https://txline-dev.txodds.com

# --- Live TxLINE credentials (required only for live mode) -------------------
# Guest auth issues the JWT; the API token comes from on-chain subscription
# activation. Both are written by the scripts above; the proxy routes read them.
TXLINE_JWT=
TXLINE_API_TOKEN=

# --- Optional upstream SSE URL overrides ------------------------------------
# Default to `${host}/api/odds/stream` and `${host}/api/scores/stream`.
# TXLINE_ODDS_URL=https://txline-dev.txodds.com/api/odds/stream
# TXLINE_SCORES_URL=https://txline-dev.txodds.com/api/scores/stream

# --- Subscription / on-chain tooling (scripts/txline-subscribe.mjs) ---------
# Path to the Solana keypair used by `npm run txline:subscribe`. DEVNET ONLY
# unless you fund the mainnet wallet yourself.
# SOLANA_KEYPAIR=~/.config/solana/id.json
# RPC endpoint (derived from TXLINE_NETWORK when unset).
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# Subscription tier passed to program.subscribe(): devnet 1, mainnet 12.
# TXLINE_SERVICE_LEVEL=1
# Comma-separated league ids for a custom bundle (empty = standard bundle).
# TXLINE_LEAGUES=

# --- Activate from a PRIOR subscribe tx (scripts/txline-activate.mjs) --------
# If you already have a confirmed on-chain subscribe tx and its wallet signature,
# skip re-subscribing and just activate:
#   TXLINE_SUB_TXSIG=... TXLINE_WALLET_SIG=... npm run txline:activate
# TXLINE_SUB_TXSIG=
# TXLINE_WALLET_SIG=
